  "source": "ClassPad.net Math - exact fx-880BTG PLUS, observed 2026-11-20 through visible keys and LCD SVG; saved directly to project.",
  "notes": [
    "2026-11-20: 29 full LCD/status observations on exact ClassPad fx-880BTG PLUS, saved directly into project. 23 accepted and six referenceOnly editing/navigation observations. No comparison masks or changed native pixels.",
    "SHIFT DEL in MathI switches between a right-pointing insertion arrow and ordinary caret before a next node; at expression end it stays ordinary. Ordinary input/navigation clears the arrow. A digit still inserts before the next digit; DEL in the simple-text control removes the previous plus sign. Repeated SHIFT DEL toggles the arrow off.",
    "Native normal arrow has seven row widths 2,4,6,8,6,4,2; tiny script arrow widths 1,2,3,4,3,2,1. Both overlay the expression rather than use a filled rectangle. Runtime cursor rows are painted in full-screen replay and in the web renderer. Standard/tiny/decimal/fraction glyphs and independent exponent insertion 2^23=8388608 checked.",
    "Visible native phase sampling after SHIFT DEL recorded two full-screen variants with 123/141 black pixels. Shape differences were observed in both phases, including a separate decimal control. Existing blink cadence was retained; no physical-device timing claim.",
    "Three beta.29 special-insertion-cursor raw observations now pass and can be reactivated unchanged. Structural deletion at fraction bar, right-operand radical insertion, and backward traversal of fraction exponent are explicitly deferred; reset-based controls prevent the earlier error cascade from being treated as a glyph result.",
    "2026-11-20 beta.90: independent native right-operand sqrt insertion confirmed the general fix; original root-applied, root-applied-result and cascading power-tiny reactivated with unchanged keys/pixels/statuses. Three structural deletion/navigation cases still held.",
    "2026-11-20 beta.91: independent root-level 12/34 controls confirm original fraction-deleted frame now matches; reactivated unchanged. Two deeper script-fraction navigation frames remain held.",
    "2026-11-20 beta.97: independently measured directed fraction slot exits, caret before powers and Undo. Original held frames insertion-cursor-script-fraction-normal,insertion-cursor-script-fraction-arrow now pass full LCD/status replay and are reactivated unchanged."
  ],
